Rem AMCAF parallel port joysticks and the second mouse's position (the golden is the original's)
For P=0 To 1
Print #1,"pj";P;Pjoy(P);Pjleft(P);Pjright(P);Pjup(P);Pjdown(P);Pfire(P)
Next P
Screen Open 0,320,200,16,Lowres : Curs Off : Flash Off : Cls 0
Limit Smouse
Smouse Speed 0
Smouse X 100 : Smouse Y 50
Print #1,"pos";X Smouse;Y Smouse
Smouse Speed 2
Print #1,"speed2";X Smouse;Y Smouse
Smouse X 30 : Smouse Y 7
Print #1,"pos2";X Smouse;Y Smouse
Smouse Speed 1
Print #1,"speed1";X Smouse;Y Smouse
Limit Smouse 10,20 To 300,180
Print #1,"limit";X Smouse;Y Smouse
Smouse X -5 : Smouse Y -3
Print #1,"neg";X Smouse;Y Smouse
